id: pm-swarm-capacity-aware-lane-admission
title: Capacity-aware lane admission and continuation packets
description: "Track https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/issues/99 and coordinate with companion item pm-cli-website-8yz0."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-swarm#99"
created_at: "2026-11-25T08:30:21.206Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-25T19:27:47.787Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Declare and observe windowed capacities, enforce counted admission for next and start, fence interruptions across reclaim, and transfer a bounded continuation packet in Git and shared tracker modes."
comments[51]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-25T08:30:46.293Z",codex-agent,"Baseline reproduced in a real non-Git tracker: capacity and interrupt were missing, capacity flags on next/start and continuation on brief were rejected, and plain next admitted two workers without a quota bound. Implementing five pushed slices with native revision checks and a real process race."
  "2026-11-25T08:33:41.905Z",codex-agent,"Slice 1: capacities are native tagged items and each observation is revision-checked and appended to the item history. The read model uses the last two in-window points when both are at most 24 hours old. Revert proof: replacing the forecast with null failed the historical 56 + 8/7 forecast assertion; restored the implementation."
  "2026-11-25T09:00:52.798Z",codex-agent,"Slice 2: next and start share primary capacity admission with dry-run and report measured refusal context and the next fallback command. Two independent next processes on disjoint work produced one admitted lane and one capacity_exhausted refusal. Revert proof: ignoring occupied slots admitted both workers; the process test failed with exits 0 and 0. The weekly replay produced 57.14 percent and three admitted lanes using the supplied readings and illustrative observation times."
  "2026-11-25T09:09:44.410Z",codex-agent,"Slice 3: one guarded native mutation records the stopped lane generation and the exhausted window. Reclaim preview and apply preserve the stopped claim until reset. An exact retry appends no duplicate record, and another generation is refused. Revert proof: bypassing the interruption check in reclaim changed the preview from refused to recovered and failed the test."
  "2026-11-25T09:15:16.699Z",codex-agent,"Slice 4: continuation commits the receiver, new token, capacity binding and packet under one native history guard. The packet replays linked files, sync paths, comments and tests in native order and reports the worktree commit IDs and dirty paths. Revert proof: dropping Git evidence failed the Git packet assertions, and skipping the native transfer failed the history and owner assertions. Independent forecast reverts also proved that disabling staleness or source-label screening fails the capacity test."
  "2026-11-25T09:22:10.767Z",codex-agent,"Slice 5: the README replay and descriptive help cover capacity admission and transfer. Fair schedule uses the same admission path and retains its flags in fallback commands. Git start also preserves a shared-mode interruption. Revert proof: reverting band help failed the help assertion, and removing the Git start guard caused the interrupted lane restart test to fail."
  "2026-11-25T09:40:44.286Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification: 741 selected tests across 59 files passed after rerunning the complete corrected privacy-sink suite and its documentation checks. The inventory covers 31 native and backend writers, including 22 history-guarded sites, with 155 privacy refusal cases and zero durable changes. All 3 linked commands passed (12 capacity, 2 continuation, 2 packed npm and Bun cases). The 2 public-corpus test cases and deadlock observation passed. Typecheck, lint, build, docstrings, duplication, identity and changelog checks passed. Repository coverage and full release execution remain with CI."
  "2026-11-25T10:08:46.571Z",codex-agent,"Exact-head CI for 2b0150c passed Node 22 and CodeQL. Node 26 passed 1281 tests and failed the unchanged coverage thresholds at 99.59 percent statements and lines, 98.67 percent branches, and 99.76 percent functions. Run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45587781231. Added ten real-tracker tests for malformed records, late resets, native fences, receiver slot reuse, absent Git provenance and Git ref movement. The new linked test passed 10 of 10. Reverting the README alone failed its runnable example assertion."
  "2026-11-25T10:24:08.556Z",codex-agent,"Follow-up verification: scoped branch diagnostics reached every branch in capacity, interruption and continuation after exercising quoted fallback arguments, invalid native generations, empty activity and incompatible command boundaries. The action selector now validates its own keys before an exhaustive dispatch. The 281-test command and lease selection passed, the updated linked boundary suite passed 12 of 12, and both packed npm and Bun cases passed again. Project coverage thresholds remain unchanged for CI certification."
  "2026-11-25T10:26:37.753Z",codex-agent,"CI at b04441b reported 100 percent statements, functions and lines and 99.77 percent branches. The Node 26 suite also caught the missing subprocess deadline in the Git interleaving fixture. Run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45592190671. Added the deadline and reran the inventory with the boundary suite. Remaining branch locations from that report are exercised by the command boundary tests and the exhaustive action dispatch."
  "2026-11-25T11:01:38.436Z",codex-agent,"Resumed draft PR #102 at bb87576 and reviewed the packed-build replay. Plan: distinguish full lane pools, add conservative dual forecasts, and allow the current holder to reread the stored continuation. Preserve reporter inputs, SDK fencing, and the documented ordered fallback command."
  "2026-11-25T11:08:43.698Z",codex-agent,"Packed-build finding 1: full pools now return capacity_lanes_occupied with active/admitted counts, reset and one runnable retry. Reported and measured exhaustion and over-limit forecasts retain distinct codes. Real processes execute the Ollama fallback for each refusal. Revert proof: restoring capacity_exhausted for the occupied branch made the final-slot race fail on the code assertion."
  "2026-11-25T11:08:46.534Z",codex-agent,"Packed-build finding 2: status exposes recent and whole-window forecasts, and policy selects recent, window or max (the default, including legacy policies). The supplied timestamps give 64.325% elapsed, 76.010% recent and 90.167% whole-window, admitting two lanes. Revert proof: selecting recent in the max branch made the fixed-clock test fail with 76.010 instead of the expected 90.167."
  "2026-11-25T11:08:48.947Z",codex-agent,"Packed-build finding 3: the current token holder rereads the saved transfer receipt without a writer lease or history append. Live reads before transfer include the current claim history. Both packet forms include linked files. Revert proof: restoring the missing-to refusal made the receiver read fail with exit 2 instead of returning the transferred packet."
  "2026-11-25T11:29:31.495Z",codex-agent,"Follow-up gates passed: 454 dependent and privacy tests across 41 files, five ordinary assignment brief tests, the 30-case linked capacity and continuation suite, and both packed consumers. Privacy checks rejected 27,130 unsafe invocations with zero tracker changes or partial receipts. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication (zero clones) and docstrings (266 declarations) passed. Scoped diagnostics exercised all new executable branches. The PR remains draft for exact-head CI."
  "2026-11-25T11:58:46.091Z",codex-agent,Resumed at 32618fc after the packed re-test confirmed the three earlier fixes. Reproducing the whole-window forecast drift by advancing the clock without adding observations.
  "2026-11-25T12:00:53.734Z",codex-agent,"The whole-window projection now uses the elapsed share at the latest observation. Admission and status share this calculation. The recent projection already uses observation timestamps. The 44, 49, 55 and 58 percent replay holds at 90.16656 percent and two admitted lanes at 10:24, +85 minutes and +6 hours. After staleness both projections are unknown and the else policy applies. A new observation at +6 hours permits a third lane. Reverting only the divisor in a disposable copy made the +85-minute assertion fail at 88.99985 instead of 90.16656."
  "2026-11-25T12:13:25.726Z",codex-agent,"Forecast re-test passed locally. The 28 selected dependent and privacy suites passed 319 tests. The linked fixed-clock replay passed, and packed npm and Bun each passed the delayed-observation scenario with matching JSON and TOON forecasts. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication and docstrings passed."
  "2026-11-25T12:55:02.158Z",codex-agent,"Resumed review at e3e635e. Read all four review threads. Plan to reproduce timestamp normalization, capacity rollover counts, disappearing Git worktrees and inherited capacity admission before editing the implementation."
  "2026-11-25T13:03:21.632Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8675ve7. Capacity declaration and observation share an explicit-zone calendar round-trip parser with interruption records read by continuation. Valid offsets normalize to UTC. The rejection checks cover November 31, non-leap February 29, 24:00 and malformed forms before native history changes. Restoring the permissive Date.parse path accepted the November 31 declaration and failed the rejection assertion."
  "2026-11-25T13:03:24.124Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8675vfB. Capacity counting and reclaim use the same live-interruption state at the decision time. The real tracker test admits a lane, interrupts it, checks reclaim, crosses the reset, re-declares with the same owner and token, and checks admission until reclaim frees the slot. Restoring the old occupancy predicate counted zero active lanes at reset instead of one."
  "2026-11-25T13:03:26.816Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8675vfH. Continuation and Git status use the same registered-checkout availability check. A missing directory retains branch commits and reports the checkout unavailable. An unrelated Git error remains visible. Removing the directory check from the continuation path made the live read fail with a Git probe error for the missing working directory.
  "2026-11-25T13:03:29.010Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8675vfM. Git attachment checks the retained provider against the live item snapshot before writing a claim or worktree. Retained Git bindings also pass admission on shared selection, handoff, continuation and reclaim. The same policy applies to preview and acquisition. Bypassing inherited admission on attachment let a denied provider create the lane and failed the required refusal."
  "2026-11-25T13:30:31.379Z",codex-agent,"Review gates passed locally. The 59 selected suites passed 757 tests and the final focused branch check passed 23 tests. Both linked commands passed, with five review regressions and two packed npm and Bun cases. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication and docstrings passed. The privacy matrix rejected 27,130 unsafe inputs with zero tracker changes or partial receipts. A second PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8675vfM revert restored selection from the older corpus binding and failed to reject the peer-rebound provider, which the current fenced read refuses."
  "2026-11-25T14:00:47.033Z",codex-agent,"Exact-head CI at the 30-minute polling cutoff for 2e9f4de59198b35b1d2d17e8c76210e3fdfb1cc5. CodeQL passed https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45624388810. test (26) in_progress  https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45624388691/job/139240617143. test (22) in_progress  https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45624388691/job/139240617595. Workflow https://github.com/unbraind/pm-swarm/actions/runs/45624388691."
  "2026-11-25T14:17:55.837Z",codex-agent,"Resumed review at 2e9f4de and preserved the prior cutoff receipt. Read all six threads. Plan to reproduce the clock, tracker selector, Git evidence and ownership faults, and measure continuation history traversal."
  "2026-11-25T14:29:01.447Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678Ixv. A real 1,000-revision SDK history with nine post-claim evidence edits took 1,831 ms to transfer and opened or read the item history 28 times, excluding setup. The disposable probe failed its two-read target. Deferred projection reuse because sharing verified replay between preflight and the lease requires a separate correctness and packet-parity change. History traversal remains unchanged."
  "2026-11-25T14:30:02.830Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678IxF. Status, admission and measured exhaustion now share the observation projection at the decision clock. The test writes 100 percent followed by a future 1 percent from an ahead clock. Restoring selection from all samples reported 1 instead of 100 and missed the exhausted limit."
  "2026-11-25T14:30:05.602Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678Ixk. Capacity refusal commands carry the effective selector relative to the invocation directory. An explicit-path test executes the refusal retry with an unrelated PM_PATH and admits the fallback. Removing the selector failed the next-command assertion.
  "2026-11-25T14:30:09.444Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678Ix4. Continuation streams complete status paths and commit records. Synchronous Git probes have explicit buffers. The test creates 13,000 newline-containing paths and checks complete entries and exact omission counts. Restoring the buffered evidence path failed with ENOBUFS."
  "2026-11-25T14:30:11.959Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678IyC. Every live incoming handoff rereads the bound item under the fence, including initially unbound handoffs. The regression inserts a denied binding and then a late interruption after corpus reads. Restoring the empty-order bypass returned the token and failed the rejection assertion."
  "2026-11-25T14:30:14.124Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P8678IyY. Ownership publications synchronize live handoff, binding and interruption fields. Git attachment clears retired context, compensation restores valid context at the newer generation, and interrupted windows retain provider evidence with a retired token. The invariant walks shared and Git start and next, handoff, continuation, reclaim and close. Keeping the prior handoff on attachment failed with the old packet token."
  "2026-11-25T14:35:38.451Z",codex-agent,"Dependent capacity regression: after the exhausted window resets, reclaim must still be able to assign a new owner. Reclaim now checks the retained provider and drops an expired binding in the same fenced update. The existing reclaim test initially failed without this case and now also asserts the expired binding is absent."
  "2026-11-25T15:06:28.975Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates passed: 1,037 tests across 72 files, with 114 focused and 923 dependent tests and zero skips. The seven PM-linked review regressions and both packed npm and Bun cases also passed. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication and docstrings passed. The privacy matrix refused 27,130 unsafe invocations with zero tracker changes and partial receipts. CI retains the full release and coverage gates at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-11-25T16:27:27.209Z",codex-agent,"Started the third review round at 294e8a5. Reproducing the five findings with real trackers and a controlled subprocess overlap, then checking the full five-state transition matrix."
  "2026-11-25T16:33:33.314Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P867_gxS. Capacity writes recheck native role on the authoritative document and retain the existing history guard. The pre-snapshot interleave retired the record through the real SDK. The original code accepted the observation, so the missing-rejection assertion failed."
  "2026-11-25T16:33:35.685Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P867_gxa. Interrupt help now asks for one bound capacity name, while provider lists remain available on next, start, schedule and transfers. The host help regression failed on the missing single-name description at the baseline."
  "2026-11-25T16:33:37.770Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P867_gxp. Absent bindings, including null packet values, unset the native binding. Reverting the normalization left runner on the transferred lane and prevented normal receiver intake. The stopped window still reports its provider evidence."
  "2026-11-25T16:33:40.488Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P867_gx4. The test starts two real CLI workers in distinct parent scopes. The first waits after admission and before native publication until the second has queued for the same lease. A disposable check-before-lease mutation admitted both workers, producing exit codes 0 and 0 where 0 and 2 are required."
  "2026-11-25T16:33:43.363Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P867_gyA. The occupied-pool regression requires a finite forecast before comparing its limit. Returning null in the refusal passed the previous coercive comparison and failed the new numeric assertion in the disposable copy.
  "2026-11-25T16:33:46.257Z",codex-agent,"Matrix baseline failed 19 of 75 cells. Orphaned: shared start, Git start, next, heartbeat, handoff, continuation without capacity, interrupt, reclaim to agent, window reset, redeclare, policy change and native terminal edit. Null: next, heartbeat, continuation without capacity and close. Exhausted: continuation without capacity and native terminal edit. Live: native terminal edit. Legacy metadata is projected as absent when the declaration is missing or terminal. Successful fenced lane writes clear it in native history. Observational transitions and refused operations preserve unrelated item histories."
  "2026-11-25T17:22:57.668Z",codex-agent,"Final matrix passed all 75 cells, including saved close receipts for legacy null input. The linked suite passed 100 checks and the dependent run passed 1,085 checks across 75 files, with zero skips. Both packed npm and Bun capacity cases passed. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication and docstrings passed. The privacy matrix refused 27,130 unsafe inputs with zero tracker changes and zero partial receipts."
  "2026-11-25T18:02:47.092Z",codex-agent,"Started the final review at 4b0710b. Reproducing the unchanged-binding race and cached-token retry in the transition matrix, and testing the deadline matcher with both false-acceptance examples."
  "2026-11-25T18:06:24.472Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P868CR2I. Recheck the captured native history before returning from unchanged-binding admission. The matrix writes a peer binding during quota lookup after the fenced item read. The original code failed the expected swarm_superseded assertion. The retry must use the peer binding and leave the edited history unchanged.
  "2026-11-25T18:06:25.825Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P868CR2O. The continuation retry carries the effective fenced token. The matrix executes the emitted command in a new CLI process. The original command failed with swarm_stale_fence. The row also executes the tokenless legacy retry.
  "2026-11-25T18:06:27.023Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P868CR2U. The deadline inventory finds the last option that can set or overwrite signal. The original matcher accepted a later spread over the signal and failed the rejection fixture. Tests also cover explicit and computed overrides.
  "2026-11-25T18:06:28.298Z",codex-agent,PRRT_kwDOVLY-P868CR2X. Reused the inventory binding walk to conservatively refuse a native signal whenever globalThis has a local declaration. The original matcher accepted the shadowing parameter and failed the rejection fixture. The unshadowed streaming Git call remains covered.
  "2026-11-25T18:39:05.889Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates passed. The linked run passed 91 checks including all 77 transition rows. The 65 dependent suites passed 818 checks with zero skips. Both packed capacity cases passed. Scoped diagnostics exercised every changed production branch. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication and docstrings passed. The privacy matrix refused 27,130 inputs with zero tracker changes and partial receipts."
  "2026-11-25T19:18:59.890Z",codex-agent,Started review round five at 5e8dff0. Checking the interrupted handoff selection first and pushing it as a separate slice before the remaining reproductions.
  "2026-11-25T19:20:14.879Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOVLY-P868EQ_F. Next and schedule skip stopped incoming handoffs and preserve their owner, token, binding and history. Preview and live selection use the disjoint ready task. With no eligible task, they report the saved stop. Both real tracker rows failed with capacity_exhausted before the change, even with a ready task and spare capacity."
  "2026-11-25T19:27:47.787Z",codex-agent,"Major slice local gates passed: 114 linked capacity and scheduling checks and 77 dependent checks with zero skips. Build, typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and existing privacy refusal matrix passed. The focused interrupted rows passed after failing on the original selection path."
